text smt98 "<p>Source-backed snapshot, not a claim that every planned replacement is complete. All missing work and receipt limits remain visible.</p><p><a href=\"/cudaplusplus/\">CUDA++, the GPU half of Omega</a> · <a href=\"/omega.json\">The complete data record</a></p>"
