text smt187 "<p><a href=\"/classic/#loop-title\">See the loop diagram in the classic dashboard.</a></p>"
text smt188 "turing"
text smt189 "<pre><code>"
text smt190 "formula"
text smt191 "</code></pre>"
text smt192 "The Machine"
text smt193 "Turning search into verified understanding"
text smt194 "mission"
text smt195 "slogan"
text smt196 "<p>Suggestions and explanations have different epistemic roles. Neural systems generate hypotheses. Explicit artifacts suit inspection and verification. Physical execution provides contact with reality, measurement determines gain, and evidence provides continuity.</p>"
text smt197 "quantities"
text smt198 "TY-2"
text smt199 "TURING-YIELD-TJ"
text smt200 "ENERGY-ATTRIBUTION"
text smt201 "GENERAL-DISCOVERY"
text smt202 "cortex"
text smt203 "research-ladder"
text smt204 "self-improvement"
text smt205 "connections"
text smt206 "CEGIS"
text smt207 "Bayesian cost prediction (belief/estimation)"
text smt208 "EXP-003"
text smt209 "Equality saturation"
text smt210 "nature"
text smt211 "top"
text smt212 "thesis"
text smt213 "<figure class=\"panel\"><h2 id=\"loop-title\">The loop</h2><p>Proposals travel the generation path, meet reality, and are scored. The evidence that survives starts the next search. A perimeter of authority, observation and receipts surrounds the whole loop.</p><p>Generation path · Evidence feedback · Verification and authority perimeter</p><p>Perimeter: around the loop, never a stage</p><ul><li>AEGIS: authority + proof boundaries</li><li>ARGUS: observation / audit</li></ul><ol class=\"loop-stages\">"
text smt214 "<li><strong>"
text smt215 "</strong><p>"
text smt216 "role"
text smt217 "</p></li>"
text smt218 "</ol><p>Back to the <strong>next AIEN / Omega search</strong>: CORTEX evidence feeds the next round.</p><ul><li>Capability system: controls what may happen</li><li>Evidence receipts: make outcomes reproducible</li></ul><figcaption>ATLAS, AienOS, AIEN, OMEGA, FORGE, REALITY, TURING and CORTEX are the stages. AEGIS, ARGUS, the capability system and evidence receipts form the perimeter around them. <a href=\"/omega/\">What Omega is</a>, in plain words, and its GPU half, <a href=\"/cudaplusplus/\">CUDA++</a>.</figcaption></figure><h2>Three questions under the loop</h2><h3>Did it learn anything?</h3><p>Turing gain: net explanatory structure that survives held-out reality.</p>"
text smt219 "<h3>What did it cost to learn?</h3><p>Turing yield: verified explanatory gain per measured physical resource.</p>"
text smt220 "<h3>Did what it learned make future discovery easier?</h3><p>Search / verification gap: whether acquired abstraction would collapse future search complexity. An open question I want to study. Nothing here is measured yet.</p><p><a href=\"/start/\">Start here</a> · <a href=\"/machine/\">The Machine</a> · <a href=\"/discovery/\">Scientific Discovery</a> · <a href=\"#evidence\">See the evidence</a> · <a href=\"#architecture\">Explore the architecture</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/aien-dev\">GitHub</a></p><ul><li>C kernel boots via UEFI: see the dated receipts.</li><li>Every claim carries a receipt.</li><li>Failures published, not hidden.</li></ul></section>"
text smt221 "architecture"
text smt222 "How it fits together"
text smt223 "<p>Hardware is treated as capability metadata, never as identity. The identity is the lineage: who wakes the machine, what keeps it alive, what checks its work, and what learns from the results.</p><p>These are responsibilities, not a literal turn order. AEGIS, FORGE, ARGUS and CORTEX serve the system by verifying, realizing, observing and remembering. Nothing receives authority merely by advancing through a diagram.</p>"
text smt224 "roles"
text smt225 "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/aien-dev/sovereign-intelligence\">Sovereign Intelligence stack map</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/aien-dev/AienOS-nv\">AienOS project</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/aien-dev/aienux\">Aienux kernel</a></p></section>"
text smt226 "facts.json"
text smt227 "live"
text smt228 "The components, as of the public-record snapshot"
text smt229 "<p>Facts gathered at "
text smt230 "generated_at"
text smt231 ". This is the checked-in public record read at build time, not live telemetry. Repository activity does not establish hardware qualification.</p>"
